#: ../content/index.rst:22
msgid "Overview"
msgstr ""

#: ../content/index.rst:24
msgid "*Roboto implements a RAG (Retrieval-Augmented Generation) system i.e., it is able to generate response suggestions for tickets based on the data from within your OTOBO.*"
msgstr ""

#: ../content/index.rst:27
#: ../content/installation.rst:4
msgid "There are two components that interface OTOBO with an LLM:"
msgstr ""

#: ../content/index.rst:29
#: ../content/installation.rst:6
msgid "The services ``otobo-ai-services``."
msgstr ""

#: ../content/index.rst:30
#: ../content/installation.rst:7
msgid "The ``otobo-ai`` OTOBO package."
msgstr ""

#: ../content/index.rst:32
msgid "The OTOBO package is the interface between OTOBO and the services. The services hold the data in a format that allows finding similar data related to a request efficiently, and interface with the LLM."
msgstr ""

#: ../content/index.rst:46
msgid "Workflow"
msgstr ""

#: ../content/index.rst:48
msgid "At first, all tickets, FAQ and external documentation are **imported**. During this step, the information is scrubbed, chunked, and sent to a small LLM to obtain a numeric vector that describes the presented information. This procedure is called embedding. Every vector describes a point in high dimensional space. Similar information will be close to each other. All the vectors and documents are stored in the otobo-ai-services. This allows for fast selection of documents that address the same topic."
msgstr ""

#: ../content/index.rst:57
msgid "If a new article is created, **generate an answer**:"
msgstr ""

#: ../content/index.rst:59
msgid "An embedding is requested for the new article. The resulting vector is used to identify related documents."
msgstr ""

#: ../content/index.rst:61
msgid "The related documents are injected into the prompt for a larger LLM to generate an answer based on the provided information."
msgstr ""

#: ../content/index.rst:62
msgid "The generated answer is stored in a Dynamic Field at the article."
msgstr ""

#: ../content/index.rst:63
msgid "The dynamic field can be referenced in an Answer Template."
msgstr ""

#: ../content/index.rst:64
msgid "If the user chooses this Answer Template, the generated answer of the LLM will be visible in the compose window."
msgstr ""

